# 🎮 Platformer Game

A 2D platformer game built entirely with Vanilla JavaScript and the HTML5 Canvas API, without using any game engines or external frameworks.

This project demonstrates core game development concepts including player physics, collision detection, enemy AI, camera systems, moving platforms, and game state management.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo

🚀 Play Online:

https://dharmayudho22.github.io/Platforner_web_game/

---

## 📸 Preview

![Game Preview](src/assets/background/Pink.png)

---

## 🎯 Features

### Player Mechanics
- Smooth left/right movement
- Jump and double jump
- Health system (3 HP)
- Temporary invincibility after taking damage
- Sprite-based animations

### Enemy System
- Patrol AI movement
- Stomp-to-defeat mechanic
- Score rewards for defeating enemies

### Level Elements
- Static platforms
- Horizontal moving platforms
- Vertical moving platforms
- Spike traps
- Rotating saw hazards

### Game Systems
- Camera follow system
- Score tracking
- Level progression
- Level Complete screen
- Game Over screen
- Win screen

---

## 🎮 Controls

| Key | Action |
|------|---------|
| A / ← | Move Left |
| D / → | Move Right |
| W / ↑ | Jump |
| Space / Enter | Start Game / Continue |
| R | Restart After Game Over |
### Tips

✅ Jump on enemies to defeat them and earn points.

⚠️ Avoid spikes and rotating saws.

🏆 Defeat all enemies to clear the level.

❤️ You only have 3 HP, so move carefully.

---

## 🛠️ Technical Highlights

Built from scratch without external libraries:

- Game loop using `requestAnimationFrame`
- AABB collision detection
- Camera tracking system
- Sprite animation handling
- Enemy patrol AI
- Moving platform logic
- Level management system
- State management (Menu, Playing, Clear, Game Over, Win)

