## 💻 Tech Stack

- Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+)
- HTML5 Canvas API
- CSS3
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Sprite Animation
- AABB Collision Detection

---

## 🚀 Run Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/dharmayudho22/Platforner_web_game.git
```

Open the project using:

- VS Code + Live Server
- Any local HTTP server

Example:

```bash
npx serve .
```

> Assets are loaded dynamically, so the game must be served through a local web server and cannot be opened directly through the file system.

